in="00:19.200" end="00:19.980">thousand </span><span begin="00:19.980" end="00:20.630">lies </span><span begin="00:20.630" end="00:20.750">have </span><span begin="00:20.750" end="00:21.110">made </span><span begin="00:21.110" end="00:21.330">me </span><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:22.450">colder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.850" end="00:28.620"><span begin="00:22.850" end="00:23.160">And </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.270">I </span><span begin="00:23.270" end="00:23.700">don't </span><span begin="00:23.700" end="00:24.250">think </span><span begin="00:24.250" end="00:24.460">I </span><span begin="00:24.460" end="00:24.810">can </span><span begin="00:24.810" end="00:25.430">look </span><span begin="00:25.430" end="00:25.800">at </span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:26.120">this </span><span begin="00:26.120" end="00:26.340">the </span><span begin="00:26.340" end="00:28.620">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.450" end="00:38.220"><span begin="00:34.450" end="00:34.800">All </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:34.890">the </span><span begin="00:34.890" end="00:35.610">miles </span><span begin="00:35.610" end="00:35.830">that </span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:38.220">separate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.770" end="00:46.300"><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:42.060">Disappear </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.310">now </span><span begin="00:42.310" end="00:42.970">when </span><span begin="00:42.970" end="00:43.330">I'm </span><span begin="00:43.330" end="00:44.180">dreamin' </span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.390">of </span><span begin="00:44.390" end="00:44.930">your </span><span begin="00:44.930" end="00:46.300">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.420" end="00:50.540"><span begin="00:47.420" end="00:47.690">I'm </span><span begin="00:47.690" end="00:48.070">here </span><span begin="00:48.070" end="00:48.690">without </span><span begin="00:48.690" end="00:49.120">you </span><span begin="00:49.120" end="00:50.540">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.730" end="00:53.990"><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:50.990">But </span><span begin="00:50.990" end="00:51.130">you're </span><span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.750">still </span><span begin="00:51.750" end="00:52.040">on </span><span begin="00:52.040" end="00:52.380">my </span><span begin="00:52.380" end="00:53.220">lonely </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.990">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.090" end="01:00.610"><span begin="00:54.090" end="00:54.240">I </span><span begin="00:54.240" end="00:54.830">think </span><span begin="00:54.830" end="00:55.400">about </span><span begin="00:55.400" end="00:55.780">you </span><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:56.790">baby </span><span begin="00:56.790" end="00:57.350">and </span><span begin="00:57.350" end="00:57.600">I </span><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:58.170">dream </span><span begin="00:58.170" end="00:58.750">about </span><span begin="00:58.750" end="00:59.220">you </span><span begin="00:59.220" end="00:59.760">all </span><span begin="00:59.760" end="00:59.900">the </span><span begin="00:59.900" end="01:00.610">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.310" end="01:03.760"><span begin="01:01.310" end="01:01.370">I'm </span><span begin="01:01.370" end="01:01.460">here </span><span begin="01:01.460" end="01:02.060">without </span><span begin="01:02.060" end="01:02.440">you </span><span begin="01:02.440" end="01:03.760">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.030" end="01:07.970"><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.260">But </span><span begin="01:04.260" end="01:04.520">you're </span><span begin="01:04.520" end="01:04.920">still </span><span begin="01:04.920" end="01:05.330">with </span><span begin="01:05.330" end="01:05.840">me </span><span begin="01:05.840" end="01:06.150">in </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.550">my </span><span begin="01:06.550" end="01:07.970">dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.470" end="01:15.100"><span begin="01:09.470" end="01:09.720">And </span><span begin="01:09.720" end="01:11.380">tonight </span><span begin="01:11.380" end="01:11.700">there's </span><span begin="01:11.700" end="01:12.630">only </span><span begin="01:12.630" end="01:13.120">you </span><span begin="01:13.120" end="01:13.240">and </span><span begin="01:13.240" end="01:15.100">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.280" end="01:29.570"><span begin="01:22.280" end="01:26.550">The </span><span begin="01:26.550" end="01:27.440">miles </span><span begin="01:27.440" end="01:27.870">just </span><span begin="01:27.870" end="01:28.280">keep </span><span begin="01:28.280" end="01:29.570">rollin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.570" end="01:34.370"><span begin="01:29.570" end="01:30.110">As </span><span begin="01:30.110" end="01:30.170">the </span><span begin="01:30.170" end="01:30.680">people </span><span begin="01:30.680" end="01:31.240">leave </span><span begin="01:31.240" end="01:31.580">their </span><span begin="01:31.580" end="01:31.960">way </span><span begin="01:31.960" end="01:32.370">to </span><span begin="01:32.370" end="01:32.880">say </span><span begin="01:32.880" end="01:34.370">hello</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.850" end="01:42.150"><span begin="01:38.850" end="01:39.310">I've </span><span begin="01:39.310" end="01:39.780">heard </span><span begin="01:39.780" end="01:39.990">this </span><span begin="01:39.990" end="01:40.650">life </span><span begin="01:40.650" end="01:40.860">is </span><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:42.150">overrated</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.810" end="01:48.160"><span begin="01:42.810" end="01:43.190">But </span><span begin="01:43.190" end="01:43.300">I </span><span begin="01:43.300" end="01:43.730">hope </span><span begin="01:43.730" end="01:44.180">that </span><span begin="01:44.180" end="01:44.500">it </span><span begin="01:44.500" end="01:44.900">gets </span><span begin="01:44.900" end="01:45.890">better </span><span begin="01:45.890" end="01:46.130">as </span><span begin="01:46.130" end="01:46.410">we </span><span begin="01:46.410" end="01:48.160">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.060" end="01:57.220"><span begin="01:54.060" end="01:54.340">I'm </span><span begin="01:54.340" end="01:54.770">here </span><span begin="01:54.770" end="01:55.360">without </span><span begin="01:55.360" end="01:55.790">you </span><span begin="01:55.790" end="01:57.220">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.440" end="02:00.550"><span begin="01:57.440" end="01:57.670">But </span><span begin="01:57.670" end="01:57.810">you're </span><span begin="01:57.810" end="01:58.400">still </span><span begin="01:58.400" end="01:58.690">on </span><span begin="01:58.690" end="01:59.060">my </span><span begin="01:59.060" end="01:59.840">lonely </span><span begin="01:59.840" end="02:00.550">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.700" end="02:07.200"><span begin="02:00.700" end="02:00.900">I </span><span begin="02:00.900" end="02:01.490">think </span><span begin="02:01.490" end="02:02.030">about </span><span begin="02:02.030" end="02:02.430">you </span><span begin="02:02.430" end="02:03.470">baby </span><span begin="02:03.470" end="02:04.030">and </span><span begin="02:04.030" end="02:04.250">I </span><span begin="02:04.250" end="02:04.830">dream </span><span begin="02:04.830" end="02:05.370">about </span><span begin="02:05.370" end="02:05.860">you </span><span begin="02:05.860" end="02:06.420">all </span><span begin="02:06.420" end="02:06.550">the </span><span begin="02:06.550" end="02:07.200">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.380" end="02:10.720"><span begin="02:07.380" end="02:07.680">I'm </span><span begin="02:07.680" end="02:08.070">here </span><span begin="02:08.070" end="02:08.710">without </span><span begin="02:08.710" end="02:09.110">you </span><span begin="02:09.110" end="02:10.720">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.750" end="02:14.430"><span begin=